/var/log/dmesg - catalog with receiving messages from kernel (hardware issues, reset after reboot)
dmesg - showing dmesg logs 
/var/log/kern.log - catalog with kernel logs
/var/log/auth.log - catalog with systhem authorization logs
logrotate - automated tool  for managaing process of logs(renaming,creating new,compresing na deleating older)
/etc/logrotate.conf - configutarion file of logrotate

14.NETWORK SHARING
scp file.txt user@remotehost.com:/remote/home - command to copy file to "user" remote address to location /remote/home
scp user@remotehost.com:/remote/home/file.txt /mydevice/remote_file/ - command to copy file from remote host and location to your location /mydevice/remote_file/
scp -r mydir user@remotehost.com:/remote/directory - copy directory and send it to "user" directory
rsync -avh /my/local/directory_one/ /my/local/directory_two/ - synchronize 2 files, working same with remote hosts
python -m http.server - starting http server in python 3
NFS -Network file system 
sudo service nfsclient start - start nfs client
sudo mount server:/directory /mount_directory  - mopnt nfs client directory
Samba - software on Linux and Unix systems  for integration, allowing a Linux server to act as a file and print server for Windows, macOS, and other Linux clients

15.NETWORK BASICS

Model OSI :
1.Physical
2.Data Link
3.Network
4.Transport
5.Session
